Info | updateFileDiagnostics published different from new diagnostics - file diagnostics:
File: smart-dash-comment.l4
  Hidden: no
  Range: 18:1-18:2
  Source: lexer
  Severity: DiagnosticSeverity_Error
  Code: <none>
  Message:
    This is – (En Dash, U+2013). It looks like `-`, but L4 only understands the plain one.

    Word processors such as Word, Pages and Google Docs swap plain punctuation for curly lookalikes as you type, so this usually means the text was pasted in from one.

    Replace it with `--` if it starts a comment, as it seems to here; if it was meant as a minus sign, use `-`.
